message: "If you use this code, model or dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "Crypto-and-Lobesia-segmentation"
abstract: >-
  Code, trained YOLO11 segmentation model and annotated dataset for the automatic
  detection and counting of Lobesia botrana and Cryptoblabes gnidiella males on the
  sticky bottoms of pheromone traps, distinguishing them from non-target insects.
